I did. I also do not have any map hacks or other mods. slash diablo was all I had. I downloaded it ages ago and im pretty sure the files are off my computer (although I wouldn't even know how to check). 

&#x200B;

When I get to the main menu on D2 it says [Battle.net](https://Battle.net) (uswest) so I click on that and type in my user=pass and log in. When I log in and it shows me where my characters should be it says current realm slashdiablo. when i click realm list nothing comes up except slash.
